  "metadata": {
    "test": {
      "height": 512,
      "width": 1024,
      "allowed": 0.001,
      "description": "Three 45-45-90 triangles with 10, 20 and 40 m legs sit flush against each other and share one 2 m rounded-corner-distance over a 1 m / 10 m ground grid. Right-angle vertices sit on 10 m grid intersections at (-40,-20), (-30,-20) and (-10,-20) m, so the 2 m tangent distance is two minor cells along each leg regardless of triangle size. The camera is top-down with a 0.25 m height so the roof outline is the footprint."
    }
  },
